 drivers/hid/hid-core.c   | 309 ----------------------------------------------
 drivers/hid/hid-quirks.c | 312 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 312 insertions(+), 309 deletions(-)

